true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "ch", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b> הסדרה מתכנסת במידה שווה לפונקציית האפס אם ורק אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(M_n\\to 0\\)</span>. בדקו את הגבול של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(M_n\\)</span> שמצאתם.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["Mn", "c", "ch", "cn", "f1", "fam", "fn", "p", "uni", "uopts", "xn"], "nvariants": 50}